  "published": "2026-09-05T03:52:26.083Z",
  "releaseNotes": "2.0.0 moves to the latest libyuv version.\n\n* JPEG/MJPEG decoding is now included using statically linked libjpeg-turbo 3.2.0.\n  For full-range JPEG RGB output, use MJPGToI420 followed by J420ToARGB;\n  upstream MJPGToARGB uses a limited-range conversion.\n* M420ToI420, M420ToARGB, GetARGBBlend, ARGBToG, and\n  SetUseReferenceImpl were removed upstream. Convert M420 input to a supported layout before calling\n  libyuv. ARGBToJ400 is available for full-range grayscale conversion.\n* RotateUV90, RotateUV180, RotateUV270, TransposeUV, and NV21ToNV12\n  remain available as aliases to their current native equivalents.\n* ScalePlane and ScalePlane_16 now return the native status code (int).\n  Native size_t parameters use UIntPtr; native char* parameters use\n  sbyte*, and signed 8-bit data uses sbyte* rather than byte*.\n* Matrix APIs accept opaque void* pointers to native YuvConstants or\n  ArgbConstants structures. These must refer to valid native structures;\n  their SIMD layout is platform specific.",
